# =============================================================================
# Refarm Monorepo — .gitignore
# Covers: Node.js, Turborepo, Astro, Rust/WASM, SQLite, OS artifacts
# =============================================================================

# ─── Turborepo ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.turbo/

# ─── Node / Package Managers ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
.pnp
.pnp.js
.yarn/cache
.yarn/unplugged
.yarn/build-state.yml
.yarn/install-state.gz
.npm/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
.pnpm-store/

# ─── Build Outputs ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
dist/
build/
out/
.next/
.nuxt/
.svelte-kit/
.output/

# Astro
.astro/

# ─── Rust / WebAssembly ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
target/
pkg/
wasm-pack.log
# NOTE: Cargo.lock IS committed for every refarm crate — cargo-component
# packages (agent, agent-tools, dispatch-surface-rs, heartwood,
# plugin-wit, …) and binaries (tractor) alike — so the toolchain that
# resolves the WIT/component build is reproducible. Do not add a blanket
# Cargo.lock ignore here.

# dispatch-surface-rs generated build artifacts
/packages/dispatch-surface-rs/dist/
/packages/dispatch-surface-rs/pkg/

# Compiled WASM outputs (keep .wat source, ignore compiled binary)
*.wasm
# Exception: checked-in WASM fixtures used in tests
!**/fixtures/**/*.wasm
!**/__fixtures__/**/*.wasm

# ─── WIT / Component Model ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Compiled component binaries (re-generated from .wit sources)
*.wasm.component
.jco-cache/
.jco-dist/
**/.jco-cache/
**/.jco-dist/

# ─── SQLite / OPFS ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.sqlite-shm
*.sqlite-wal
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal

# ─── Environment & Secrets ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.*.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
.refarm/*.key

# ─── Git Worktrees ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.worktrees/

# ─── Test Coverage & Reports ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
coverage/
.nyc_output/
*.lcov
test-results/
playwright-report/
playwright/.cache/

# ─── TypeScript ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.tsbuildinfo
*.js.map
*.d.ts.map
*.d.mts.map
*.d.cts.map

# Ignore in-place JS/DTS emissions (source is always .ts)
# Test byproducts and Local Identity
.refarm/
.dgk/

# Standard: All compiled outputs go to dist/
# Use a more targeted approach for packages
packages/**/dist/
packages/**/build/
packages/**/.turbo/
# JS/declaration files never belong in src/ — guard against tsc emitting without outDir
packages/**/src/**/*.d.ts
packages/**/src/**/*.d.ts.map
packages/**/src/**/*.js.map

# ─── Editor & IDE ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.claude/agents/
.vscode/
!.vscode/extensions.json
!.vscode/settings.json
!.vscode/tasks.json
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# ─── Logs ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
logs/
*.log

# ─── Miscellaneous ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.cache/
tmp/
temp/
deps-report.md

# ─── Benchmarks ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Keep baseline.json versioned, ignore temporary outputs
**/benchmarks/gha-payload.json
**/benchmarks/current.json
**/benchmarks/gha-payload-dispatch.json
**/benchmarks/current-dispatch.json
**/benchmarks/gha-payload-reload.json
**/benchmarks/current-reload.json
**/benchmarks/gha-payload-grant.json
**/benchmarks/current-grant.json
**/benchmarks/gha-payload-tokens.json
**/benchmarks/current-tokens.json
**/benchmarks/report.md

# ─── Generated Github Tag Artifacts ───────────────────────────────────────────────
# Ignore generated test output files
**/*_tags.txt

# Ignore export plans
*_plan*.md
*prompt*.md
!docs/superpowers/**/*.md

# Python bytecode
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo

# Coding Agents
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock
.workflows/

# PI Lens cache
.pi-lens/

# Claude agent settings (keep local overrides, ignore global settings)
.claude/settings.json

# Generated WIT bindings — wit-bindgen writes src/bindings.rs during `cargo component
# build`; it is NOT source (regenerated on every build) and must never be committed for a
# product package (matches the delegate/lsp-code-ops/agent convention). The
# packages/health `no-tracked-generated-bindings` test enforces this. EXCEPTION: the
# frozen plugin fixtures under tractor/tests/fixtures commit theirs on purpose (a static
# snapshot with no build step, so tests run without a component build).
packages/*/src/bindings.rs
validations/**/src/bindings.rs
!packages/tractor/tests/fixtures/**/src/bindings.rs

# Superpowers subagent-driven-development scratch (ledger, briefs, reports, review packages).
# Per-plan working area; the durable record is git history + docs/superpowers/.
.superpowers/
